# Deploy immediately

After finishing a change set that should go live (Presetpunk/Scopepunk/site):

1. Commit with a concise message (user asked for deploy-on-finish — treat as commit permission for shippable work).
2. Push `main` to `origin`.
3. Watch `pages.yml` until green; report the Pages URL.

Do not ask “deploy?” — just ship. Skip only for pure questions, WIP the user marked as draft, or when they explicitly say not to push.
